# scitex-stats environment variables
#
# `cp .env.example .env` and edit. Loaded automatically when the package
# initializes; explicit kwargs/CLI flags still take precedence.

# Path to a YAML config file overriding scitex-stats defaults.
# Resolution: $SCITEX_STATS_CONFIG -> ~/.scitex/stats/config.yaml -> built-in defaults.
# SCITEX_STATS_CONFIG=

# Cross-package signal set by scitex-logging when present; scitex-stats reads
# it to attach the SciTeX logger vs stdlib logging. Usually you don't set
# this directly — it's surfaced by the umbrella `import scitex` import.
# SCITEX_LOGGING_AVAILABLE=
